mer's invoice list, should we just show every invoice that exists (so effectively only delivered orders), or also show placeholder or pro-forma entries for orders that haven't been delivered yet? → assumed: List all existing invoices (created at Delivered) with payment status; no placeholders for undelivered orders"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-7","fromSpan":["I-3","I-11","I-10"],"id":"ASM-31","risk":"high","text":"What happens to a product that is active in the catalogue but has no price on the customer's assigned price list? → assumed: Visible but shown as 'price on request' and cannot be added to the basket"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-8","fromSpan":["I-13","I-11"],"id":"ASM-32","risk":"high","text":"At checkout, the price check finds that a price changed after the item went into the basket. What happens? → assumed: Update the basket to the current price, show the customer what changed, and require them to confirm again before submitting"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-9","fromSpan":["I-3","I-12","I-13"],"id":"ASM-33","risk":"high","text":"What does the out-of-stock check at checkout block? → assumed: Only products whose status is Out of stock; quantity is not checked against imported stock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-10","fromSpan":["I-12"],"id":"ASM-34","risk":"low","text":"How does the nightly ERP stock CSV reach the portal, and what format is it in? → assumed: The ERP drops the file into a configured folder or SFTP location that the import job reads; the columns are agreed with the client"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-11","fromSpan":["I-12"],"id":"ASM-35","risk":"high","text":"A stock file is otherwise valid, but some rows have unknown product codes, and some active products are missing from the file. How should the import treat these? → assumed: Skip unknown rows and log them; products missing from the file keep their previous stock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-12","fromSpan":["I-12","I-3"],"id":"ASM-36","risk":"low","text":"How is the Low stock threshold defined? → assumed: One system-wide quantity set by admins in system settings"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-13","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-37","risk":"low","text":"Which timezone and which non-working days apply to the 14:00 cutoff and working-day calculations? → assumed: One configured business timezone, with admins keeping a list of non-working dates (public holidays included) as well as weekends"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-14","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-38","risk":"low","text":"How far ahead can a customer choose a delivery date? → assumed: Any working day from the earliest available date up to a configurable number of days ahead (e.g. 30)"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-15","fromSpan":["I-11","I-16"],"id":"ASM-39","risk":"high","text":"Do prices include tax, and do order and invoice totals show tax? → assumed: Prices are entered and shown excluding tax; no tax is calculated in this phase"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-17","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-40","risk":"low","text":"Should a basket be kept between sign-ins? → assumed: Yes: one saved basket per user, kept until checkout or cleared"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-19","fromSpan":["I-14"],"id":"ASM-41","risk":"low","text":"How should staff rejections be recorded? → assumed: Use Cancelled status with a required rejection reason, marked as staff-rejected in the timeline"},{"fromDefault":"notifications","fromQuestion":"Q-20","fromSpan":["I-14","I-5"],"id":"ASM-42","risk":"low","text":"Who gets order emails (confirmation, amendment, rejection, out for delivery), including for orders staff create? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-21","fromSpan":["I-14","I-16"],"id":"ASM-43","risk":"low","text":"How are order and invoice numbers formatted? → assumed: Separate sequential numbers with a configurable prefix (e.g. ORD-000123, INV-000123)"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-22","fromSpan":["I-11","I-17"],"id":"ASM-44","risk":"high","text":"An admin deactivates a price list that customers are still assigned to. What happens? → assumed: Block deactivation while any active customer is assigned to it"},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q-24","fromSpan":["I-6","I-17"],"id":"ASM-45","risk":"high","text":"Can Administrators also do everything Office Staff can (order queue, confirming orders, invoices)? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-25","fromSpan":["I-9"],"id":"ASM-46","risk":"low","text":"How should password reset links and invitations expire, and can invitations be resent? → assumed: Reset link valid 1 hour, invitation 7 days (both configurable); admins can resend, which cancels the earlier invitation"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-26","fromSpan":["I-9"],"id":"ASM-47","risk":"low","text":"Can a user whose account is locked request a password reset, and does completing the reset unlock the account? → assumed: Yes: they can request a reset, and completing it clears the lock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-27","fromSpan":["I-10","I-17"],"id":"ASM-48","risk":"low","text":"Do categories need to be nested? → assumed: One flat level of categories"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-28","fromSpan":["I-10","I-2"],"id":"ASM-49","risk":"low","text":"Where does vehicle compatibility data come from? → assumed: Admins enter it by hand for each product (make/model/year/engine/variant)"},{"fromDefault":"search","fromQuestion":"Q-29","fromSpan":["I-2","I-10"],"id":"ASM-50","risk":"low","text":"How should catalogue search match and rank results? → assumed: Search by name or title with simple filters; no full-text search engine."},{"fromDefault":"reporting","fromQuestion":"Q-30","fromSpan":["I-7"],"id":"ASM-51","risk":"low","text":"What should the basic sales and product reports contain? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-31","fromSpan":["I-6"],"id":"ASM-52","risk":"low","text":"Which orders go into 'the day's delivery list' export? → assumed: Orders with today's delivery date (or a chosen date) in Confirmed, Picking or Out for delivery status"},{"fromDefault":"languages","fro